  "notes": "Third-party (mischianti.org) pinout titled 'WeMos LOLIN ESP32 C3 pico'. Board silkscreen recorded first in functions when it differs, then the dark number box. The battery connector bracket also carries '3 GPIO03 ADC_BATTERY' (battery sense), not a separate pin. The small back-view inset repeats the same headers and was not transcribed separately. Skipped per rule 1: RST and GPIO9/BOOT buttons, USB-C, antenna."
